# The handover document is local only, by decision on 2026-10-11.
#
# It is written for the next session in a different workspace: current state, what is left, the
# constraints, and the traps that cost the most time. It includes host-specific paths and notes about
# which session did what, so it stays on this machine. Everything it states as a fact is also in the
# committed documents (README, TODO, DESIGN-enforcement, RULES, CHANGELOG) -- this file is the guided
# path through them, not the only copy of anything.
#
# The file itself also says so at the top, because someone will eventually find it and wonder whether
# it should be committed.
HANDOVER.md
